# Builds the CrossByte half of the relay interoperability test.
#
# The suite proves the TURN exchange against a server this repository wrote,
# which verifies a request with the very code that produced it -- so the two
# would agree about anything they are both wrong about. This half talks to
# node-turn, an implementation of RFC 5389 and 5766 written by somebody else,
# which is what makes an accepted allocation evidence rather than an echo.
#
# Run it with `node ci/relay/run.js` once built.
-cp src
-cp tests
-cp tests/relay
-D windows
-D HXCPP_M64
-main RelayInteropPeer
--cpp export/relay
